      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4832,
      "text": "And He is the One Who enriches and bestows wealth,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4833,
      "text": "and that He is the Lord of Sirius[17].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4834,
      "text": "And that He destroyed the earlier ‘Ād[18],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4835,
      "text": "and Thamūd[19], sparing none,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4836,
      "text": "and [He destroyed] the people of Noah before them; they were indeed more wicked and more rebellious.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4837,
      "text": "And He toppled the cities[20] upside down,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4838,
      "text": "and they were utterly covered [by stones][21].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4839,
      "text": "Then which of the favors of your Lord do you doubt?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4840,
      "text": "This [Prophet] is a warner like the earlier warners.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4841,
      "text": "The imminent Hour has drawn near,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4842,
      "text": "none but Allah can disclose it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4843,
      "text": "Do you find this discourse astonishing,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4844,
      "text": "and you laugh [at it] and not weep,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4845,
      "text": "while heedlessly lost in amusement?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 61,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4846,
      "text": "So prostrate to Allah and worship [Him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 62,
