        "recommended": false,
        "obligatory": true
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4847,
      "text": "The Hour has drawn near and the moon has split asunder[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4848,
      "text": "Whenever they see a sign[2], they turn away and say, “Same old magic!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4849,
      "text": "They deny [the truth] and follow their desires, but every matter will reach its inevitable end.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4850,
      "text": "There have already come to them stories [of destroyed nations] that are sufficient to deter them,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4851,
      "text": "which contain extensive wisdom, but the warnings are of no avail.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
        "numberOfAyahs": 55,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 463,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4852,
      "text": "So turn away from them [O Prophet]. On the Day when the caller[3] will summon them to a horrific event[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 54,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القَمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qamar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Moon",
